829
01:10:22,671 --> 01:10:24,674
Verna, get on the fucking ground!

830
01:10:25,966 --> 01:10:27,260
Come here!

831
01:10:30,386 --> 01:10:32,055
Maybe I'm on a roll...

832
01:10:32,096 --> 01:10:34,099
...and I'll kill every damn Sawyer I see.

833
01:10:40,522 --> 01:10:42,692
Jed, Jed...

834
01:10:44,483 --> 01:10:48,697
<i>Jed... Are you okay down there?

835
01:10:51,365 --> 01:10:52,367
<i>Jed?

836
01:10:52,491 --> 01:10:53,994
<i>Come on, now.

837
01:10:58,040 --> 01:10:59,000
Hold on.

838
01:10:59,082 --> 01:11:01,709
Come on, we've got you. We've got you, Jed.

839
01:12:19,494 --> 01:12:22,707
This will hold it together while it heals...

840
01:12:25,000 --> 01:12:26,836
All right, you're going to feel this...

841
01:12:26,960 --> 01:12:28,460
I'm going to pull it pretty tight.

842
01:12:37,303 --> 01:12:38,597
All right...

843
01:12:44,601 --> 01:12:45,811
Jed...

844
01:13:19,718 --> 01:13:21,262
I'll help you.

845
01:13:23,430 --> 01:13:25,350
I swear.

846
01:13:27,433 --> 01:13:29,937
Untie me, please...

847
01:13:31,229 --> 01:13:32,606
Please...

848
01:13:33,523 --> 01:13:34,816
Why?

849
01:13:41,613 --> 01:13:43,909
What were you going to do to me?

850
01:13:46,495 --> 01:13:48,039
I don't know...

851
01:13:53,460 --> 01:13:57,421
I'm sorry, I am...

852
01:14:06,931 --> 01:14:08,685
Jesus Christ!

853
01:14:10,977 --> 01:14:12,396
Let's go...

854
01:14:24,116 --> 01:14:25,993
<i>Nubbins, come here.

855
01:14:37,963 --> 01:14:39,257
Bring your brother something to eat.

856
01:14:39,298 --> 01:14:40,548
All right.

857
01:14:47,095 --> 01:14:48,973
<i>They're gone! They're gone!

858
01:14:53,561 --> 01:14:55,188
Go, go...

859
01:15:02,694 --> 01:15:05,114
No!

860
01:15:05,197 --> 01:15:06,491
Leave her alone!

861
01:15:06,866 --> 01:15:08,285
No.

862
01:15:09,452 --> 01:15:11,370
Hurry, bring him.

863
01:15:20,545 --> 01:15:21,845
You messed with the wrong family!

864
01:15:21,880 --> 01:15:24,343
Yeah, you're proud of this damn family, aren't
you?

865
01:15:25,507 --> 01:15:26,551
Jed!

866
01:15:29,553 --> 01:15:30,931
Jed!

867
01:15:43,026 --> 01:15:44,904
Oh, fuck!

868
01:15:51,659 --> 01:15:53,954
What are you going to do?

869
01:16:04,672 --> 01:16:06,299
It's not over, boy!

870
01:16:06,549 --> 01:16:07,842
Goddamn it!

871
01:16:09,258 --> 01:16:11,052
This isn't over, damn it! You hear me?

872
01:16:11,134 --> 01:16:14,098
Jed, what have I told you about strangers?

873
01:16:14,264 --> 01:16:16,225
They fill your ears with lies...

874
01:16:16,266 --> 01:16:18,143
Show them who you are, Jed.

875
01:16:19,435 --> 01:16:21,939
Look what that man did to your face!

876
01:16:27,568 --> 01:16:29,153
Jackson, don't do it!

877
01:16:30,947 --> 01:16:32,616
No!

878
01:16:32,699 --> 01:16:34,743
Shut up. You're next, you hear me?

879
01:16:34,784 --> 01:16:35,744
Fuck you!

880
01:16:36,244 --> 01:16:37,872
No!

881
01:16:45,460 --> 01:16:46,671
No!

882
01:17:51,902 --> 01:17:53,320
Go, go, go! Get her now!

883
01:17:53,355 --> 01:17:54,197
Go get her!

884
01:17:55,739 --> 01:17:58,493
Jed, remember what I told you? Go get her.

885
01:17:58,700 --> 01:17:59,619
Get her, Jed!

886
01:18:00,953 --> 01:18:02,580
Nobody messes with our family!

887
01:19:51,393 --> 01:19:53,605
Help me!

888
01:19:56,815 --> 01:19:59,611
No!

889
01:20:18,212 --> 01:20:19,797
Jackson, don't do this!

890
01:20:21,130 --> 01:20:23,467
Please, don't do this!

891
01:20:24,592 --> 01:20:26,136
I tried to help you...

892
01:20:26,511 --> 01:20:28,305
That's all I ever tried to do.

893
01:20:28,555 --> 01:20:29,932
You know that, right?

894
01:20:30,640 --> 01:20:33,018
Listen to me, it's not too late...

895
01:20:33,476 --> 01:20:35,269
We can still get out of here together.

896
01:20:35,560 --> 01:20:37,312
That bitch is a liar, Jed!

897
01:20:37,895 --> 01:20:39,356
She doesn't care about you...

898
01:20:39,814 --> 01:20:41,568
Kill her! Kill her now!

899
01:20:41,608 --> 01:20:43,361
Please don't listen to her.

900
01:20:44,319 --> 01:20:45,738
Please.

901
01:20:46,196 --> 01:20:47,657
I know there's good in you...

902
01:20:48,115 --> 01:20:49,241
I've seen it.

903
01:20:49,907 --> 01:20:53,120
Please listen to me. This isn't you, Jackson!

904
01:20:54,370 --> 01:20:55,539
This isn't you!

905
01:20:56,080 --> 01:20:57,667
It's your crazy mother!

906
01:20:58,083 --> 01:20:59,210
It's her...

907
01:21:15,143 --> 01:21:16,687
That's my boy!

908
01:21:17,228 --> 01:21:18,937
You did good, Jed.

909
01:21:22,607 --> 01:21:24,568
You made your mama proud.

910
01:21:27,528 --> 01:21:31,284
<i>No!

911
01:23:53,296 --> 01:24:48,852
<i>Leatherface (2017)
Subtitles by TaMaBin
